<title>USA: Health Fitness unit acquires Iowa company.</title>
<headline>Health Fitness unit acquires Iowa company.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Fitness Physical Therapy Inc said Friday its wholly owned subsidiary, Health Fitness Rehab Inc, acquired Duffy &amp; Associates Physical Therapy PC of Des Moines, Iowa.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Duffy &amp; Associates provides outpatient physical therapy, sports medicine and occupational health services.</p>
<p>Health Fitness is a preventive and rehabilitative healthcare company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
